DATA FOLDER - IND320
====================

This folder holds static raw data files. They are not changed by the code.

--------------------------------------------------------------------
reservoirs.csv
--------------------------------------------------------------------
What:     NVE Magasinstatistikk, weekly reservoir filling in Norway.
Source:   Provided with the course for Oblig1. Same data as NVE's
          Magasinstatistikk API:
          https://biapi.nve.no/magasinstatistikk/swagger/index.html
Period:   1995-01-08 to 2026-09-06, one row per area per week.
Columns:  dato_Id, omrType, omrnr, iso_aar, iso_uke, fyllingsgrad,
          kapasitet_TWh, fylling_TWh, neste_Publiseringsdato,
          fyllingsgrad_forrige_uke, endring_fyllingsgrad
Areas:    omrType = NO   -> all of Norway (omrnr 0)
          omrType = EL   -> electricity price areas NO1-NO5 (omrnr 1-5)
          omrType = VASS -> 3 water course areas (omrnr 1-3):
                            1 = East (Austlandet, Agder, parts of Rogaland)
                            2 = West (rest of Rogaland, most of Vestland)
                            3 = North (Møre og Romsdal, Trøndelag, Nord-Norge)
Used by:  Only Oblig1. The app and Oblig2 fetch the same data from the API.

